@WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5147

### Health
GET {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Register
POST {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@worklanex.local",
  "password": "DemoPass123",
  "fullName": "Demo User"
}

### Login
POST {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@worklanex.local",
  "password": "DemoPass123"
}

### Me (replace token after login)
GET {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List workspaces
GET {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create workspace
POST {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Product team",
  "description": "Main delivery workspace"
}

### List projects in workspace (set workspaceId)
@workspaceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project in workspace
POST {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MVP launch",
  "description": "First release scope"
}
